<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 84 FOR TWO AT LUNCH V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 84 FOR TWO AT LUNCH V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, chasing Australia's first innings 243 all out, were 84 for two at lunch on the second day of the fifth and final test at the WACA Ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 243 all out (Michael Bevan 87 not out, Mark Waugh 79, Curtly Ambrose five for 43); West Indies 84 for two.</p>
